---
const nav = [
  { href: '#approach', label: 'Abordagem' },
  { href: '#systems', label: 'Sistemas' },
  { href: '#method', label: 'Método' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-dark.png" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-dark.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon-light.png" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <meta name="description" content="INTEGR cria sistemas empresariais confiáveis com inteligência artificial, engenharia e clareza." />
    <title>INTEGR | O futuro tem origem</title>
    <link rel="preload" as="image" href="/assets/integr-office-hero.png" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/entrance.css" />
    <script is:inline src="/entrance.js"></script>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="entrance" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="entrance-signature">
        <img src="/assets/integr-real-logo-white.png" alt="" width="5499" height="1775" />
        <svg class="entrance-lines" viewBox="0 0 240 48" fill="none">
          <path d="M0 8 H240" stroke="#CEAD86" />
          <path d="M0 24 H240" stroke="#D27836" />
          <path d="M0 40 H240" stroke="#B74521" />
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <header class="site-header" data-header>
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="INTEGR, início">
        <img src="/assets/integr-real-logo-white.png" alt="INTEGR" width="5499" height="1775" />
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Navegação principal">
        {nav.map((item) => <a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a>)}
      </nav>
      <a class="header-cta" href="https://cal.com/integr/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Falar com a Integr <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main id="top">
      <section class="hero chapter" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <div class="hero-text-panel">
          <div class="hero-heading-box">
            <p class="hero-slogan">O futuro tem origem.</p>
            <h1 id="hero-title"><span class="hero-desktop-title"><span>Construímos sistemas</span><span>que sustentam</span></span><span class="hero-mobile-title">Sistemas para</span><span class="hero-level"><em aria-label="o próximo nível."><span class="phrase-word phrase-word--cream" aria-hidden="true">o</span> <span class="phrase-word phrase-word--amber" aria-hidden="true">próximo</span> <span class="phrase-word phrase-word--orange" aria-hidden="true">nível.</span></em></span></h1>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-copy"><span class="hero-desktop-copy">Sua operação depende de processos manuais, ferramentas desconectadas e decisões sem clareza? É daí que começamos.</span><span class="hero-mobile-copy">Transformamos complexidade em estrutura para sua empresa crescer.</span></p>
          </div>
          <a class="button button--light" href="https://cal.com/integr/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Falar com a INTEGR <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-caption" aria-hidden="true"><span>INTEGR</span><span>Systems with intent</span></div>
      </section>

      <section id="approach" class="approach chapter" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
        <div class="chapter-label">O problema</div>
        <div class="approach-grid">
          <h2 id="approach-title"><span>Crescer</span> <span>não deveria</span> <span>significar perder</span> <span>o controle.</span></h2>
          <div class="approach-text">
            <p>Quando processos, dados e decisões se espalham, cada nova ferramenta aumenta o ruído. <span class="approach-desktop-copy">A tecnologia deixa de orientar o negócio e passa a exigir atenção. </span><span class="statement">A primeira etapa é entender o sistema que já existe.</span></p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-wave" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 900 1080" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
            <!-- Concentric quarter circles keep 80-unit bands and 12-unit gaps through both bends. -->
            <path class="motif-ribbon motif-ribbon--cream" d="M668 -300 V365 A208 208 0 0 1 460 573 H360 A452 452 0 0 0 -92 1025 V1400" />
            <path class="motif-ribbon motif-ribbon--amber" d="M760 -300 V365 A300 300 0 0 1 460 665 H360 A360 360 0 0 0 0 1025 V1400" />
            <path class="motif-ribbon motif-ribbon--orange" d="M852 -300 V365 A392 392 0 0 1 460 757 H360 A268 268 0 0 0 92 1025 V1400" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="turn chapter" aria-labelledby="turn-title">
        <div class="turn-image"><img src="/assets/turn-conference-room.png" alt="Sala de conferências envidraçada da INTEGR, com uma cadeira vazia e luz natural." width="1670" height="942" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="turn-panel">
          <div class="turn-copy">
            <p class="kicker">A virada</p>
            <h2 id="turn-title"><span>Tecnologia não é o destino.</span><span class="turn-title-emphasis">É a estrutura.</span></h2>
            <p class="turn-lead">Desenhamos os sistemas certos para que a empresa avance com clareza, honestidade e passos possíveis.</p>
            <a class="text-link" href="#systems">Ver como trabalhamos <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="systems" class="systems chapter" aria-labelledby="systems-title">
        <div class="systems-pin">
          <header class="systems-header">
            <p class="chapter-label">O sistema vivo</p>
            <div class="system-detail-stack" aria-live="polite">
              <article class="system-detail is-active" data-system-detail aria-hidden="false">
                <span class="system-detail-phase">01 / 04 · CONTEXTO</span>
                <h2 id="systems-title">Enxergar o todo.</h2>
                <p>Antes de construir o próximo nível, entendemos o sistema que já sustenta o negócio.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="system-detail" data-system-detail aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="system-detail-phase">02 / 04 · SISTEMAS</span>
                <h2>Fazer o sistema sustentar.</h2>
                <p>Transformamos complexidade operacional em estrutura clara, integrada e confiável.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="system-detail" data-system-detail aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="system-detail-phase">03 / 04 · DADOS + IA</span>
                <h2>Transformar sinais em decisão.</h2>
                <p>Dados organizados e inteligência aplicada revelam o próximo movimento com precisão.</p>
              </article>
              <article class="system-detail" data-system-detail aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="system-detail-phase">04 / 04 · CRESCIMENTO</span>
                <h2>Escalar sem perder o controle.</h2>
                <p>Construímos capacidade para crescer com mais velocidade, visibilidade e consistência.</p>
              </article>
            </div>
          </header>
          <div class="systems-timeline" data-system-timeline>
            <div class="timeline-rail" aria-hidden="true"><span data-timeline-progress></span></div>
            <ol class="system-stages" aria-label="Etapas do sistema vivo">
              <li class="system-stage-row is-active" data-system-stage>
                <span class="stage-index">01 / 04</span>
                <div class="stage-copy"><span class="stage-phase">CONTEXTO</span><h3>Enxergar o todo.</h3></div>
                <div class="stage-node"><strong>01</strong><span>O QUE JÁ EXISTE</span></div>
              </li>
              <li class="system-stage-row" data-system-stage>
                <span class="stage-index">02 / 04</span>
                <div class="stage-copy"><span class="stage-phase">SISTEMAS</span><h3>Dar estrutura ao negócio.</h3></div>
                <div class="stage-node"><strong>02</strong><span>ESTRUTURA</span></div>
              </li>
              <li class="system-stage-row" data-system-stage>
                <span class="stage-index">03 / 04</span>
                <div class="stage-copy"><span class="stage-phase">DADOS + IA</span><h3>Ler os sinais.</h3></div>
                <div class="stage-node"><strong>03</strong><span>INTELIGÊNCIA</span></div>
              </li>
              <li class="system-stage-row" data-system-stage>
                <span class="stage-index">04 / 04</span>
                <div class="stage-copy"><span class="stage-phase">CRESCIMENTO</span><h3>Ampliar capacidade.</h3></div>
                <div class="stage-node"><strong>04</strong><span>PRÓXIMO PASSO</span></div>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="method" class="method chapter" aria-labelledby="method-title">
        <div class="method-image"><img src="/assets/lobby.png" alt="Lobby conceitual da INTEGR com plantas, concreto e luz natural." width="1672" height="941" loading="lazy" /></div>
        <div class="method-copy">
          <p class="chapter-label">O método</p>
          <h2 id="method-title">
            <span><span class="method-word"><span class="method-wordmark">Integr</span>idade</span> também</span>
            <span>é uma tecnologia.</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="method-lead">Falamos o que precisa ser feito, o que ainda não precisa e qual é o próximo passo correto.</p>
          <p class="method-note">Sem prometer atalhos. Sem esconder complexidade atrás de palavras bonitas.</p>
          <ul aria-label="Princípios do método">
            <li><span>01</span><strong>Entender</strong><em>antes de construir</em></li>
            <li><span>02</span><strong>Priorizar</strong><em>antes de acelerar</em></li>
            <li><span>03</span><strong>Entregar</strong><em>com clareza</em></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="contact" class="contact chapter" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
        <div class="contact-brand">
          <img src="/assets/integr-real-logo-white.png" alt="INTEGR" width="5499" height="1775" />
          <p>O futuro tem origem.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="chapter-label">O próximo passo</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Vamos encontrar a origem do seu próximo sistema.</h2>
        <a class="button button--accent" href="https://cal.com/integr/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Falar com a Integr <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <p class="contact-note">Engenharia de sistemas. Inteligência artificial. Decisões com origem.</p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="footer-text"><span>INTEGR</span><span>O futuro tem origem.</span></div>
      <nav class="social-links" aria-label="Redes sociais">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/br.integr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram da INTEGR (abre em nova aba)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="5" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4" />
            <circle cx="17.5" cy="6.5" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none" />
          </svg>
          <span>Instagram</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://wa.me/5511942393021?text=Gostaria%20de%20ser%20atendido." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Conversar com a INTEGR no WhatsApp (abre em nova aba)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M20.5 11.7a8.5 8.5 0 0 1-12.6 7.5L3 20.5l1.3-4.8a8.5 8.5 0 1 1 16.2-4Z" />
            <path d="m8.3 7.5 1.5 2.7-1.1 1.1a8.2 8.2 0 0 0 4 4l1.1-1.1 2.7 1.5c-.3 1.1-1.2 1.8-2.3 1.6-4.2-.7-7.3-3.8-8-8-.2-1.1.5-2 1.6-2.3Z" transform="translate(1 -1) scale(.95)" />
          </svg>
          <span>WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </footer>

    <script>
      const systemsSection = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#systems');
      const timeline = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-system-timeline]');
      const stages = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-system-stage]'));
      const details = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-system-detail]'));
      const timelineProgress = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-timeline-progress]');
      const header = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-header]');
      const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
      const mobileSystems = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 760px)');
      let activeDetailIndex = 0;
      let pendingDetailIndex = -1;
      let detailTimer: number | undefined;
      const clamp = (value: number, min = 0, max = 1) => Math.min(max, Math.max(min, value));
      const update = () => {
        const rect = systemsSection?.getBoundingClientRect();
        if (!mobileSystems.matches && timeline && rect && stages.length) {
          const progress = clamp((-rect.top) / Math.max(1, rect.height - window.innerHeight));
          timelineProgress?.style.setProperty('height', `${progress * 100}%`);
          const activeIndex = reduced.matches ? stages.length - 1 : Math.min(stages.length - 1, Math.floor(progress * stages.length));
          stages.forEach((stage, index) => {
            stage.classList.toggle('is-active', index === activeIndex);
            stage.classList.toggle('is-complete', index < activeIndex);
          });
          const nextDetailIndex = reduced.matches ? stages.length - 1 : activeIndex;
          if (nextDetailIndex !== activeDetailIndex && nextDetailIndex !== pendingDetailIndex) {
            window.clearTimeout(detailTimer);
            pendingDetailIndex = nextDetailIndex;
            details[activeDetailIndex]?.classList.remove('is-active');
            details[activeDetailIndex]?.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
            detailTimer = window.setTimeout(() => {
              activeDetailIndex = nextDetailIndex;
              pendingDetailIndex = -1;
              details.forEach((detail, index) => {
                const active = index === activeDetailIndex;
                detail.classList.toggle('is-active', active);
                detail.setAttribute('aria-hidden', active ? 'false' : 'true');
              });
            }, reduced.matches ? 0 : 180);
          }
        }
        header?.classList.toggle('is-scrolled', window.scrollY > 30);
      };
      const syncSystemsLayout = () => {
        window.clearTimeout(detailTimer);
        pendingDetailIndex = -1;
        document.querySelector('.system-detail-stack')?.setAttribute('aria-live', mobileSystems.matches ? 'off' : 'polite');
        details.forEach((detail, index) => {
          detail.classList.toggle('is-active', index === activeDetailIndex);
          detail.setAttribute('aria-hidden', mobileSystems.matches || index === activeDetailIndex ? 'false' : 'true');
        });
        update();
      };
      mobileSystems.addEventListener('change', syncSystemsLayout);
      syncSystemsLayout();
      window.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
      window.addEventListener('resize', update);
      update();

      document.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        const target = event.target;
        if (!(target instanceof Element)) return;
        const link = target.closest<HTMLAnchorElement>('a[href^="#"]');
        const href = link?.getAttribute('href');
        if (!link || !href || href === '#') return;
        const destination = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>(href);
        if (!destination) return;
        event.preventDefault();
        destination.scrollIntoView({ behavior: reduced.matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'start' });
        history.pushState(null, '', href);
      });

      update();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Instrument+Sans:wdth,wght@75..100,400..700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');
  @font-face { font-family:'Kvant Logo'; src:url('/assets/kvant-trial-bold.otf') format('opentype'); font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
  :root { --ink:#170f07; --paper:#eee6d6; --cream:#cead86; --amber:#d27836; --orange:#b74521; --line:rgba(238,230,214,.2); --logo:'Kvant Logo','KVENT','Kvant','Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif; --mono:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; --display:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; } html { scroll-behavior:auto; } body { margin:0; background:var(--ink); color:var(--paper); font-family:var(--display); } a { color:inherit; } .site-header { position:fixed; z-index:10; inset:0 0 auto; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr; align-items:center; padding:18px 4vw; transition:background .25s ease, padding .25s ease; } .site-header.is-scrolled { background:rgba(23,15,7,.88); backdrop-filter:blur(14px); padding-block:12px; } .brand { width:144px; height:46px; display:flex; align-items:center; } .brand img { display:block; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:contain; object-position:left center; } nav { display:flex; gap:30px; font:11px var(--mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; } nav a, .header-cta, .text-link { text-decoration:none; } nav a { opacity:.72; transition:opacity .2s; } nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible { opacity:1; } .header-cta { justify-self:end; font:11px var(--mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; } .header-cta span, .button span { margin-left:12px; } .chapter { position:relative; overflow:hidden; } .hero { min-height:100svh; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:16vh 8vw 12vh; background:#24170e; isolation:isolate; } .hero-backdrop { position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:-3; background-image:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(23,15,7,.78) 0%,rgba(23,15,7,.42) 42%,rgba(23,15,7,.08) 78%),url('/assets/integr-office-hero.png'); background-position:center center; background-size:cover; background-repeat:no-repeat; opacity:.96; } .hero-content { max-width:820px; width:100%; padding:clamp(1.1rem,2.4vw,2.2rem) clamp(1.1rem,2.8vw,2.8rem); background:transparent; border:0; border-radius:0; box-shadow:none; backdrop-filter:none; -webkit-backdrop-filter:none; } .hero-slogan { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; margin:0 0 24px; padding:9px 15px 8px; border:1px solid rgba(238,230,214,.42); border-radius:999px; background:rgba(210,120,54,.92); color:var(--paper); box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(23,15,7,.2); font:500 11px var(--mono); letter-spacing:.12em; text-transform:uppercase; } .kicker, .chapter-label { font:11px var(--mono); letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--cream); } .brand-slogan { margin:10px 0 18px; color:var(--amber); font:12px var(--mono); letter-spacing:.08em; } h1,h2,p { margin:0; } h1 { font-size:clamp(3.5rem,5.8vw,6.4rem); line-height:.92; letter-spacing:-.07em; max-width:700px; width:fit-content; } .hero-heading-box { position:relative; z-index:0; isolation:isolate; width:fit-content; max-width:100%; padding:clamp(.75rem,1.5vw,1.25rem) clamp(.85rem,1.7vw,1.45rem); } h1 span { display:block; } .hero-level { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:clamp(.55rem,1vw,1rem); } h1 em { color:var(--amber); font-style:normal; } .hero-level em { color:var(--paper); } .hero-level em .phrase-word { display:inline; } .hero-level em .phrase-word--cream { color:var(--cream); } .hero-level em .phrase-word--amber { color:var(--amber); } .hero-level em .phrase-word--orange { color:var(--orange); } .hero-copy { width:min(100%,680px); max-width:680px; margin:26px 0 28px; color:#e0cdb4; font:400 clamp(.95rem,1.2vw,1.05rem)/1.6 var(--display); } .button { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; min-height:50px; padding:0 19px; text-decoration:none; font:12px var(--mono); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.07em; transition:transform .18s ease, background .18s ease; } .button:hover, .button:focus-visible { transform:translateY(-2px); } .button--light { background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); } .button--accent { background:var(--amber); color:var(--ink); }
 .hero-slogan { padding:11px 18px 10px; font-size:13px; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.1em; }
